"section": "Add BAM Read Support",
"url": "usage/index.html#add-bam-read-support",
"text": "get_mnv \\   --vcf variants.vcf \\   --bam reads.bam \\   --fasta reference.fasta \\   --gff genes.gff3 Without a BAM, get_MNV annotates what the caller reported. With one, it counts the reads itself, and only then can it tell a real codon-level haplotype from two substitutions that never shared a molecule. See Linkage for what that buys you."
