"text": "get_mnv \\   --vcf variants.vcf \\   --fasta reference.fasta \\   --gff genes.gff3 \\   --gff-features CDS Use --gff-features CDS when you want codon-aware protein annotation from CDS features, especially for eukaryotic GFF/GTF files. CDS rows with transcript_id or Parent are reconstructed as spliced transcript CDS models."
